    "json": [
      {
        "path": "count",
        "op": "eq",
        "value": 1
      },
      {
        "path": "xrefs[0].kind",
        "op": "eq",
        "value": "call"
      },
      {
        "path": "xrefs[0].from_function.name",
        "op": "eq",
        "value": "sub_140001040"
      }
    ]
  },
  "notes": "Vendored twin of the reported PE (GH-456): sub_140001010 is called only from a switch case body an MSVC delta jump table dispatches to -- LEA RDX,[__ImageBase]; MOV ECX,[RDX + RBX*0x4 + 0x2000]; ADD RCX,RDX; JMP RCX. The computed jump had no successor, so the case bodies were never decoded and this answered count 0."
